               POS=(02,02),LTH=0005,ATTR=(NUM,PROT)                             
FLD0208  DFLD  POS=(02,08),LTH=0004,ATTR=(NUM)                                  
FLD0308  DFLD  POS=(03,08),LTH=0004,ATTR=(NUM,PROT,MOD)                         
